#showas:保姆
"First expedition of humanity threw almost all of our forces at the AI Overlord, but all of them were annihilated because of AI's unexpected minions. Still, they were able to do considerable amount of damage to the Overlord and leave the Overlord's brain in a semi-lobotomized state.

Now, we are the second expedition, and we are in the command of a single Ark starship, while Nanocaust and Scourge -AI's powerful minions- are left to babysit him until the overlord recovers."

This is on a "realistic" and "rectangular" map type, with 120 planets.

The player is an Ark Empire with a random starting Ark, and with random fleets.

You are against one Difficulty 5 Quadratic AI, the AI has an Intensity 8 Scourge ally, also an intensity 8 Nanocaust ally, who invades the galaxy right from the start.

It will probably be a good idea to hurry up before Nanocaust and Scourge start to get going; pierce through the AI's territory and snipe the AI's brain. Or what's left of it...